BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ios-chora-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-gremiotissa-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri of Panagia Gremiotissa\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Ios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Ios's biggest feast — the Dormition\, celebrated at the cliff-edge church of Panagia Gremiotissa crowning Chora. Morning liturgy\, then the whole village tips into eating\, dancing and music until dawn\, with fireworks over the harbour. The walk up through the white lanes at dusk is half the experience.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ios/#chora-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-gremiotissa-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ios/#chora-dormition-panigiri-of-panagia-gremiotissa-chora
END:VEVENT
