BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ios-agia-theodoti-nativity-of-the-virgin-panigiri-agia-theodoti--2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270907
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270909
SUMMARY:Nativity of the Virgin panigiri\, Agia Theodoti and Paleokastro
LOCATION:Agia Theodoti\, Ios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On 7-8 September the church at Agia Theodoti beach and the chapel of the Virgin inside the Byzantine fort of Paleokastro both celebrate the Nativity of the Virgin\, with vespers\, a shared meal and music. Paleokastro is a steep 20-minute climb from the road\, so most people go to Agia Theodoti in the evening and up to the castle for the morning liturgy.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ios/#agia-theodoti-nativity-of-the-virgin-panigiri-agia-theodoti-
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ios/#agia-theodoti-nativity-of-the-virgin-panigiri-agia-theodoti-
END:VEVENT
