UID:ios-koumbara-panigiri-of-agios-nikolaos-koumbara-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271207
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Nikolaos\, Koumbara
LOCATION:Koumbara\, Ios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The chapel of the sailors' saint at Koumbara beach\, west of the port\, is where Ios celebrates 6 December: liturgy\, then food and wine for the handful of islanders who are around in winter. Worth knowing if you are on Ios out of season.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ios/#koumbara-panigiri-of-agios-nikolaos-koumbara
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ios/#koumbara-panigiri-of-agios-nikolaos-koumbara
END:VEVENT
